of all the kernel.org keysigning party announcements popping-up on
LKML lately?  If so, then make yourself known!

I am readily available to meet in/near Raleigh, NC (and points west).
If you are a legitimate Linux kernel developer and you are interested
in meeting-up for a kernel.org keysigning, please let me know.
